@startuml
title v1.6 Authorised Institutional Retrieval
actor User
participant Conversation
participant "Retrieval Service" as R
participant "Embedding Provider" as E
participant Qdrant
participant PostgreSQL
participant "Prompt Builder" as P
User -> Conversation: Prompt + attachment version IDs
Conversation -> R: Query, active tenant/role/scope
R -> PostgreSQL: Verify every attachment and permission
R -> E: Embed query
R -> Qdrant: Search with server tenant filter
Qdrant --> R: Candidate chunks
R -> PostgreSQL: Defence-in-depth access check
R -> PostgreSQL: Persist retrieval trace
R --> P: Verified institutional source pack + excerpts
P --> Conversation: Source-aware model prompt
@enduml
